    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +4 and ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 15%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- \"Crossover\" or \"Defenders of Justice\" Category allies' DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\nfor 2 turns\n*When HP is 80% or less, or when facing 2 or more enemies*\n- Performs a critical hit\n*When attacking with 12 or more Ki*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 15%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*As the 2nd or 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*As the 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming\na Super Attack\n*When 3 or more \"Crossover\" or \"Defenders of Justice\" Category allies\nare on the team, or when there are 3 Super Class allies attacking\nin the same turn*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- High chance of performing a critical hit\n- Randomly changes Ki Spheres of a certain Type (PHY & STR excluded)\nto PHY Ki Spheres\n- Foresees enemy's Super Attack within the character's attacking turn\nstarting from the 4th turn from the start of battle",
